        <item>
            <title>2.33.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 19:21:58 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>118</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.33.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Features
- Clicking an image thumbnail in a session now opens it in its own window at full size (capped to the screen) instead of an overlay confined to the pane, so images stay readable with several panes open
- The image window zooms like Preview: pinch, Cmd+= / Cmd+-, Cmd+0 for actual size, Cmd+9 to fit, and double-click to toggle fit and actual size
- "Open in Preview" is available from the image window's title bar and context menu, and from the thumbnail's right-click menu

### Changes
- A worktree launch now names the branch and the session title in one call, so both describe the task in the same words, and that title is kept rather than regenerated
]]></description>
